## Part 2: Voice Commands (3 minutes)

### Narrator:
"Instead of typing, Alex decides to try voice commands."

### On Screen:
- Alex clicks the 🎤 Voice button
- Button turns red: "🔴 Listening"
- Alex speaks: **"Show me my spending"**

### System:
- Transcribes voice to text
- Switches to Money tab
- AI responds (spoken aloud):
  > "You've spent $1,247 this month. Your biggest categories are dining out ($312), groceries ($198), and subscriptions ($156). Want me to show your subscriptions?"

### On Screen:
- Money tab shows:
  - Total balance: $3,456.78
  - This month's spend: $1,247.00
  - Subscriptions list (Netflix, Spotify, Gym)
  - Recent transactions

### Narrator:
"Alex is impressed. The app understood natural speech and showed relevant data."

